611
00:51:10,167 --> 00:51:14,292
The real Pastor's somewhere else.
We are on our way to get him.

612
00:51:19,334 --> 00:51:21,959
- Now you owe me, okay?
- Huh?

613
00:51:34,751 --> 00:51:37,334
What are you doing at my office?

614
00:51:42,626 --> 00:51:44,125
What are these people?

615
00:51:45,209 --> 00:51:46,876
Mag Sa Jang?

616
00:51:57,167 --> 00:51:58,709
Thank you.

617
00:51:58,709 --> 00:52:00,584
Don't move.

618
00:52:13,292 --> 00:52:15,125
- Hyun Kyung!
- Detective Eo!

619
00:52:19,083 --> 00:52:21,000
Detective Eo!

620
00:52:21,000 --> 00:52:22,500
Detective Eo!

621
00:52:22,500 --> 00:52:24,250
Detective Eo!

622
00:52:24,751 --> 00:52:26,751
Detective Eo!

623
