626
00:52:49,626 --> 00:52:51,125
Detective Eo!

627
00:52:57,334 --> 00:52:58,834
Detective Eo!

628
00:53:00,959 --> 00:53:02,876
I think she's in here.

629
00:53:09,626 --> 00:53:11,918
Dong Gi, wait.

630
00:53:11,918 --> 00:53:14,876
Step back. Back!

631
00:53:26,542 --> 00:53:28,167
- You okay?
- Yeah!

632
00:53:28,167 --> 00:53:31,292
Hyun Kyung!

633
00:53:31,292 --> 00:53:33,584
Detective Eo!

634
00:53:33,584 --> 00:53:36,083
- Are you okay?
- What took you so long?

635
00:53:36,083 --> 00:53:37,667
I almost died waiting for you.

636
00:53:37,667 --> 00:53:40,250
My bad. Let's get you out.

637
00:53:40,250 --> 00:53:41,751
Easy, easy.

638
00:53:41,751 --> 00:53:43,417
Be careful!

639
00:53:43,417 --> 00:53:45,876
- You okay?
- Yeah.

640
00:53:45,876 --> 00:53:47,792
Hyun Kyung!

641
00:53:47,792 --> 00:53:51,125
- Hyun Kyung, are you okay?
- Lieutenant.

642
00:53:51,125 --> 00:53:52,459
The Pastor?

643
00:53:52,459 --> 00:53:54,292
We found out where he is.

644
00:54:05,584 --> 00:54:07,584
- Let me fill it up for you.
- Thank you.

645
00:54:09,125 --> 00:54:12,751
Drink up. You won't get any in prison.

646
00:55:18,417 --> 00:55:21,125
This yacht and everything in it

647
00:55:21,125 --> 00:55:23,834
will be confiscated, okay?

648
00:55:23,834 --> 00:55:26,959
Make yourself at home until
we take you to the station.

649
00:55:26,959 --> 00:55:29,375
This yacht is not mine. I rented-

650
00:55:43,709 --> 00:55:45,751
When did you learn to drive a yacht?

651
00:55:45,751 --> 00:55:47,125
Ah, this?

652
00:55:47,125 --> 00:55:50,792
I decided that I needed this skill
after a maritime case back when-

653
00:55:50,792 --> 00:55:52,626
Okay, good for you.

654
00:55:53,250 --> 00:55:55,876
Got it. Just drive, okay?

655
00:56:21,125 --> 00:56:22,500
There you go.

656
00:56:25,500 --> 00:56:28,250
I'm so grateful to you
for taking care of my baby.

657
00:56:28,250 --> 00:56:30,042
I can't thank you enough.

658
00:56:30,042 --> 00:56:34,125
Come to me if anything comes up. Okay?

659
00:56:34,125 --> 00:56:36,751
Think of me as your father.

660
00:56:37,459 --> 00:56:39,209
It's just that...

661
00:56:39,209 --> 00:56:41,751
I'll miss her so much.

662
00:56:43,000 --> 00:56:44,292
Oh, about Mi Yeong's baby,

663
00:56:44,292 --> 00:56:48,167
