664
00:56:48,167 --> 00:56:49,500
Really?

665
00:56:50,292 --> 00:56:51,918
That's such a relief.

666
00:56:53,000 --> 00:56:54,375
I…

667
00:56:54,375 --> 00:56:56,000
I'll be back.

668
00:56:56,000 --> 00:56:57,709
Yeah, you do that, okay?

669
00:56:58,542 --> 00:57:00,876
So adorable!

670
00:57:01,542 --> 00:57:03,500
- Thank you.
- Take care.

671
00:57:03,500 --> 00:57:04,876
Go on.

672
00:57:58,918 --> 00:57:59,876
Pull over!

673
00:57:59,876 --> 00:58:03,375
The most important thing
is the safety of the citizens, and your own.

674
00:58:03,375 --> 00:58:05,125
So should I let them get away?

675
00:58:05,125 --> 00:58:06,959
- Is a cop...
- Lieutenant!

676
00:58:06,959 --> 00:58:10,125
Supposed to do nothing
while the suspect gets away?

677
00:58:10,709 --> 00:58:11,918
Can we talk?

678
00:58:11,918 --> 00:58:13,500
Is it Choi Gang Won?

679
00:58:13,500 --> 00:58:15,792
The taxi driver you're looking for?

680
00:58:17,667 --> 00:58:21,292
He continues to cause accidents,
committing random crimes.

681
00:58:22,417 --> 00:58:25,042
No telling what he will do
unless we catch him fast.

682
00:58:28,209 --> 00:58:30,876
[People Of The Police Station]

683
00:58:32,667 --> 00:58:35,334
572.4 billion won.

684
00:58:35,334 --> 00:58:39,751
The total amount of fraudulent
car insurance claims last year.

685
00:58:39,751 --> 00:58:42,584
They take up more than half
of all insurance frauds.

686
00:58:42,584 --> 00:58:44,918
[Lieutenant Min So Hee, TCI]
Even I, a police officer,

687
00:58:44,918 --> 00:58:47,292
[National Office Of Investigation]
came close to falling for it.

688
00:58:47,292 --> 00:58:49,042
As you saw in the show,

689
00:58:49,042 --> 00:58:53,542
a woman faking her pregnancy
fell down next to the car I was driving.

690
00:58:53,542 --> 00:58:56,459
She did that on purpose,
with a cushion under her shirt.

691
00:58:56,459 --> 00:58:57,834
[Wrist Scam]

692
00:58:57,834 --> 00:59:00,167
It's called a 'wrist scam.'

693
00:59:00,167 --> 00:59:05,083
It usually happens in alleyways
or parking lots with no CCTV.

694
00:59:05,083 --> 00:59:08,167
They bump into a car and demand compensation.

695
00:59:08,167 --> 00:59:09,834
That is the typical approach.

696
00:59:12,334 --> 00:59:13,751
[Rear-End Scam]

697
00:59:13,751 --> 00:59:15,334
Here's another one.

698
00:59:15,334 --> 00:59:18,500
A rented car, full of passengers,
hits the car in front on purpose.

699
00:59:18,500 --> 00:59:23,083
And the passengers split the
insurance money among themselves.

700
00:59:23,083 --> 00:59:26,375
They recruit 'passengers' with ads such as,

701
00:59:26,375 --> 00:59:29,209
"Rear-End Part-Timer Wanted, Earn 300,000 Won in a Day."

702
00:59:29,918 --> 00:59:32,584
[Organized Fraud]
In some cases, there is an organization involved.

703
00:59:32,584 --> 00:59:36,709
In the worst case scenario,
you might end up paying a huge sum.

704
00:59:37,834 --> 00:59:40,042
So, what should we do about it?

705
00:59:41,125 --> 00:59:44,292
[1. Record The Scene]
First, record the scene.

706
00:59:44,292 --> 00:59:47,834
Keep your dash cam on,

707
00:59:47,834 --> 00:59:51,334
and take pictures of the location and how the cars collided.

708
00:59:51,334 --> 00:59:54,542
[2. Obtain Their Personal Information]
Second, get their personal information.

709
00:59:54,542 --> 00:59:57,584
Name, contact number, insurance information,

710
00:59:57,584 --> 01:00:00,250
and check for CCTV locations in the vicinity.

711
01:00:00,250 --> 01:00:04,542
[3. Follow The GPS]
Third, listen to your GPS system.

712
01:00:04,542 --> 01:00:08,626
The system alerts you when you approach
areas with records of staged accidents.

713
01:00:09,167 --> 01:00:12,918
[4. Report all incidents officially]
Fourth, do not settle privately.

714
01:00:12,918 --> 01:00:14,959
Report the accident to the police.

715
01:00:16,375 --> 01:00:20,125
When you are in an accident,
you panic and want it over quickly.

716
01:00:20,125 --> 01:00:23,876
That is the weakness
that these scammers exploit.

717
01:00:23,876 --> 01:00:28,000
Don't panic or rush through things. Remain calm.

718
01:00:28,000 --> 01:00:32,626
These criminals stage accidents
and paint innocent drivers as offenders.

719
01:00:32,626 --> 01:00:34,918
Let's stop these criminals together.
